# Copy to frontend/.env.development (gitignored):
#   cp frontend/.env.development.example frontend/.env.development
#
# Mode-scoped, not plain frontend/.env: vitest runs as mode "test" and would
# otherwise inherit this, and two leveling tests `new URL()` what the api layer
# builds, which throws on a relative "/api". Dev mode wants relative so the SPA
# rides Vite's dev proxy (server.proxy in vite.config.ts) and stays same-origin
# for the session cookie; test mode wants http.ts's absolute fallback instead.
# Mirrors what `.claude/skills/worktree/worktree.sh write_env` generates per
# worktree slot (#1479).
VITE_API_URL=/api
